* TAOCP 1.3.2 finds the maximum of n elements. Returns m and j s.t. m = X[j], and j is the maximum such index
*
* rA is m, rI1 is n, rI2 is j, rI3 is k, CONTENTS(X + i) is X[i]
*
X	EQU	1000
START	EQU	3000
	ORIG	START
INIT	ENT3	0,1	M1. Initialize
	JMP	CHANGEM
LOOP	CMPA	X,3	M2. Compare
	JGE	*+3
CHANGEM	ENT2	0,3	M4. Change m
	LDA	X,3
	DEC3	1	M5. Decrease k
	J3P	LOOP	M2. All tested?
	HLT
	END	START
